title: "Import reads a source by path after validating it, so a concurrent replacement can escape the directory or the size bound"
description: "GH issue #65: https://github.com/unbraind/pm-memory/issues/65 · author @unbraind · created 2026-11-13T00:28:33Z · updated 2026-11-13T00:28:33Z"
